cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use Helio in your research or product, please cite it as below.'
title: 'Helio: the open-source, AI-native growth platform'
abstract: >-
  Helio is an open-source, self-hostable marketing-automation and
  customer-engagement platform. It unifies customer data (CDP), segments
  audiences, orchestrates cross-channel journeys on a durable workflow engine
  (Temporal), sends email/SMS/push/WhatsApp, and exposes AI-native features —
  natural-language segments and journeys, predictive scoring, brand-voice
  content generation, and an MCP server for AI agents — on a modern TypeScript
  and Python stack.
type: software
